WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.180
- If you know BuzzFeed, you know we're obsessed

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.713
with finding the next big Internet challenge.

00:00:04.953 --> 00:00:06.055
^- What are you?

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.000
- This time, we don't just wanna master it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.053
We wanna make it go viral.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.450
When I found out about the #LemonFaceChallenge,

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.787
I was like, "Oh, yeah, I can do this.

00:00:14.787 --> 00:00:15.747
"I can eat a lemon.

00:00:15.747 --> 00:00:17.040
"Lemons are delicious."

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.750
But then I found out that the Lemon Face Challenge

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.653
is actually for a good cause.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.880
Aubreigh, who has DIPG, and her mother

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.140
were hoping that people will take the challenge

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.433
and donate to the cause.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.680
The Lemon Face Challenge is already catching on.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.563
The Arizona Diamondbacks have done it, the LA Dodgers.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.090
You're eating a lemon, making a silly, sour face.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.100
You might look at somebody biting into a lemon

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.957
and think, "Wait, how in the world

00:00:37.957 --> 00:00:41.000
"does that help kids with DIPG?"

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.690
Well, that's exactly what I'm going to ask Brooke,

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.900
who, along with her daughter,

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.880
started the Lemon Face Challenge.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.240
- We had always heard of the Ice Bucket Challenge

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.600
for ALS and wanted to do something

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.890
to get awareness out there.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.210
They thought of when life gives you lemons,

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:56.097
you make lemonade.

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:58.800
- Oh, that makes so much sense!

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.620
When you're given lemons, make lemonade.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.260
So, like, the lemonade that you're making

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:04.310
is basically raising awareness,

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:07.403
and encouraging people to donate to charity.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.670
- [Brooke] So the ALS bucket challenge was a huge success.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:14.930
It raised something like 115 million in 2014 alone.

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:18.730
And that money led to research breakthroughs.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:19.673
It was incredible.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.928
- Do you know anything about research going on?

00:01:21.928 --> 00:01:24.340
- We know that it only affects about 300 a year.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.370
There are a few trials or something going on.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.050
It just doesn't seem to be a big target.

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.530
- If you can get the awareness out there,

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.853
they may be more apt to try to find more trials to do.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.640
- If somebody does the Lemon Face Challenge

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:37.560
and they wanna donate money--

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:38.393
- [Brooke] Two ways.

00:01:38.393 --> 00:01:39.550
- We wanna make sure that people realize

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:41.330
if you donate to Aubreigh's Army,

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.033
^that is for her medical expenses.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.345
^We were looking into a foundation

00:01:45.345 --> 00:01:48.066
that handles DIPG that's called The Cure Starts Now.

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.953
- [Sara] thecurestartsnow.org.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.543
- Their thing is targeting research for DIPG.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.360
- You can give money to help Aubreigh,

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.700
or you can give money to help future research.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.143
I have a lemon here.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.384
- We happen to have two.

00:02:00.447 --> 00:02:01.863
- Are you guys ready?

00:02:02.026 --> 00:02:02.859
- Ready to do it

00:02:02.859 --> 00:02:03.692
- Let's do it.

00:02:06.529 --> 00:02:07.362
Mm.

00:02:07.787 --> 00:02:08.940
- Gets me every time.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.740
- It's sour, but it still tastes good to me.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:11.573
I still like it.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.803
- So we end that with when life hands you lemons,

00:02:13.803 --> 00:02:14.636
you make lemonade.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.410
- Is there any, like, celebrity

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.273
you wanna challenge to do it?

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:20.140
- [Brooke] Ellen.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.030
- You hear that, Ellen?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.473
You have officially been Lemon Challenged.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:26.610
I accept the Lemon Face Challenge

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:28.543
to raise awareness for DIPG.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.043
I challenge you, Eric.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.664
I know you're out there in LA,

00:02:34.664 --> 00:02:36.270
but you're gonna eat this lemon,

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.300
and you're gonna donate for DIPG.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.330
- So Sara just tweeted me the Lemon Face Challenge.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.163
I really wanna do this.

00:02:41.163 --> 00:02:42.280
One, because I love lemons.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:43.407
And two, because it's a really important

00:02:43.407 --> 00:02:44.560
and great cause, and we can

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.363
use BuzzFeed to make it go viral.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.513
LA sucks!

00:02:47.513 --> 00:02:51.093
I have to walk 30 minutes one way to get some lemons.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.193
I'm sweating so hard right now.

00:02:52.193 --> 00:02:54.010
- All right, Eric, get the lemons.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.009
I challenged Eric.

00:02:55.009 --> 00:02:56.173
Check one.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.040
I'm gonna get more people to do

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.570
the Lemon Face Challenge than Eric.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.670
All right, this is now a challenge.

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:02.666
It's a competition.

00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:05.060
And it is for a good cause.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:05.893
Let's do it.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.240
- My name is Clark, and I'm about to

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.623
do the Lemon Face Challenge for DIPG.

00:03:11.068 --> 00:03:13.651
(upbeat music)

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.450
- So it looked a little iffy for Eric there

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.430
on whether he would be able to even get himself

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:22.910
to do the Lemon Challenge, but Eric pulled through.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:23.743
So I got my lemon.

00:03:23.743 --> 00:03:25.680
I think you just eat it and make a face.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.440
I'm a sensitive Jewish boy.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:30.900
I could feel the heartburn starting.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.120
But I did it for you, Aubreigh!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.220
I wanna make this go viral,

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.670
and I am currently in the LA office,

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.640
where most of our big BuzzFeed personalities are.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.137
So I'm gonna go around the office

00:03:38.137 --> 00:03:40.450
and get all them to eat some lemons for Aubreigh.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.283
Let's go.

00:03:41.283 --> 00:03:42.116
- Ha ha ha.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.263
- [Eric] All right, Curly, I need you to eat some lemons

00:03:45.263 --> 00:03:47.303
for the Lemon Face Challenge.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.038
- Lemons are my favorite.

00:03:49.038 --> 00:03:51.233
Aubreigh, I hope you're doing well.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.520
Sending you tons of love and all good wishes

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.320
and all the warmth that you deserve.

00:03:56.753 --> 00:03:57.586
Mm.

00:03:57.586 --> 00:03:58.440
- Ladylike is over there.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.390
I'm gonna go get someone from Ladylike.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.350
- Well, this was a pretty simple challenge.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.250
Pretty tasty, too.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:11.893
- Oh, that's something.

00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:15.791
- [Woman] Oh, my god!

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.043
- Ew.

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:23.780
- Everyone has lemons.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.150
Lemons are easy to get, unless you're Eric in LA.

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:28.170
So Eric got a ton of people,

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.220
and I got a ton of people.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.720
I mean, honestly, we both won.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:33.943
^So grab a lemon, do the Lemon Face Challenge,

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.580
^post it on social media, and let's get this trending.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.840
That's why we're donating the entire budget

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.173
for this video to Aubreigh's Army.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.160
If you can take the time to do something

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.050
as fun and goofy as bite a lemon

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.423
and give some money to these charities,

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:50.460
you should do it.

